{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>台中市長盧秀燕表示，這款自駕巴士具備全電動、開放道路行駛等特色，行經路段需應付車流、行人及複雜交通環境。市交通局長葉昭甫說，自駕巴士行駛時速約30至35公里，試乘階段周一至周五運行，首班上午10時發車、末班下午4時20分發車，每天會有14班。（中央社）</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T07:04:04.048932+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":126,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T06:03:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T08:17:25.619004+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T06:57:26.502597+00:00","content_hash":"ebf9f997d7020081ac4936b3032dca37eba39c162a17612d1d79c69d6928281d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}